    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418920/extras/6c7a31b196e260182ed15c0f19365487.avif?t=1754416945\" width=490 height=88 /></span>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>New twist in Liminal Spaces</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal and unsettling environments that blur the line between reality and nightmare, inspired by liminal aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Atmospheric Horror</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the unease of the 1990s-inspired setting with haunting visuals and creppy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>High Replay Value</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural elements and unpredictable monster behavior make every playthrough unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Twisted entity AI</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creppy and unpredictable movements based on random waypoints/sound detection AI.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal urbanism is a single-player game, a solo project with a unique idea of combining\u00a0the nostalgic and eerie feeling of liminal spaces with cityscapes and landscapes. The game consists of 4 Major levels with a twisted entity roaming the cityscapes. In every update a new level entry will be added with each update until i give the best experience of Liminal Urbanism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Liminal Urbanism is a single-player survival horror game that immerses you in a haunting, surreal world of liminal spaces and decaying urban environments. Set in a desolate 1960s up to 2000s inspired cityscapes, the game invites you to explore an eerie set of levels at the start of your journey.",
